        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city has become overrun by a criminal enterprise, and the bosses are using their extravagant wealth to hire an army of thugs. In this throwback to the 2.5D beat 'em ups of the early 90's, play as a resident who's fed up with the crime and decides to break up the racket with his fists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money comes flying out of the bad guys that you hit. Once that happens, it's a race to see who can collect the money first. Get to it first to charge your power bar and use your special attacks, which are critical to survival and progressing through the game. But if the enemies get to it first, they can do the same thing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through this arcade-style throwback and find out who's behind this criminal racket... and make sure they're clobbered for good.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city has become overrun by a criminal enterprise, and the bosses are using their extravagant wealth to hire an army of thugs. In this throwback to the 2.5D beat 'em ups of the early 90's, play as a resident who's fed up with the crime and decides to break up the racket with his fists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money comes flying out of the bad guys that you hit. Once that happens, it's a race to see who can collect the money first. Get to it first to charge your power bar and use your special attacks, which are critical to survival and progressing through the game. But if the enemies get to it first, they can do the same thing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through this arcade-style throwback and find out who's behind this criminal racket... and make sure they're clobbered for good.</p>",
        "short_description": "A short, arcade-style throw back to the beat 'em ups of the early 90's. Use the money you beat out of wealthy criminals to charge your power attacks while attempting to find the mastermind behind the criminal racket taking over your city.",
